            "review_title": "Review at DMZ Bar - Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Christopher T\nVancouver, Canada3 contributions\n0\nWent with friends for beer and dinner\nMar 2020\nNice street ambiance, we sat at the tables outside., the staff were friendly, attentive and the draft beer was cold. We took advantage of the buy 2 get three deal they had going at the time. The 5x7 pool table is a nice touch. As for the food I'm afraid to say that on the day we went it was terrible. The ribs I ordered were the toughest I have ever had anywhere. The plate came with 5 grey meatless ribs with a drizzle of sauce. The other 2 meals were also equally unimpressive.. They sell cool DMZ tee shirts, we bought a couple of them\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 12, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
