            "review_text": "976Louise\nVancouver, Canada29 contributions\n0\nThey need to improve in many areas.\nJan 2020\nThe place has only one attraction for some pand that is the pool table. The food was mediocre and the drinks are expensive. Service was poor. The place is too chopped up so not sociable. They do not take credit cards, a big minus. I can not think of any reason to go back again.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 31, 2020\nDMZ Bar - Restaurant Da Nang\nWe truely sorry for that !!\nSince our bar is still new and has few feedbacks, we know that there are some minus points in the bar that could displease customers.\nThank you for your feedback, we will take it into considerations and improve the situation.\nIn the near future, we definitely will accept credit card as payment.\nRead more\nWritten February 8, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
