            "review_text": "Peter W\nDa Nang, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nBest Billiard bar in DaNang!\nJan 2020 • Solo\nI often come here to have a good time. To have some drinks and to play Billiard (for free!). They also have a good food cuisine. The staff is always very friendly and speaks English. This DMZ bar offers a very nice atmosphere and I 100% can recommend it. You won't be disapointed!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 7, 2020\nDMZ Bar - Restaurant Da Nang\nDear Peter,\n\nThank you very much for taking your time for us.\n\nWe are very happy to hear that you have been satisfied our dishes and understood real us Food.\n\nWe promise to do our best to preserve and serve these best banquet dishes to our respect quests with story-telling about \"Bar and Restaurant in Vietnam\"\n\nHope to see you in the near future.\n\nHappy New Year\nRead more\nWritten January 12, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
