            "review_text": "Keagan storm ledden\n2 contributions\n0\nA whole new surprise\nJan 2020 • Family\nMe and my family have been in danang for about a week now and we walked past this bar a few times , we said it had an interesting theme and had free pool so we wanted to try it out for atleast one night and going there has been such a great experience in terms of the staff being incredibly friendly and playful as well as they where very keen to talk to us about danang the alchohol was decently priced and the food was way better than the food in the surrounding areas (not to be rude) , so ultimately I decided to rate them because they deserve it . \n\nPs there is free wifi\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 3, 2020\nDMZ Bar Danang\nThank you very much for your feedbacks and your choice on our services. Hope that your trip in Danang city have remarked your experience in the long life of travelling. \n\nMay you will have a prosperous year with your health and your work. See you again in Danang city!\nRead more\nWritten January 6, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
